sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Client
    participant A as Inference API
    participant G as Governance
    participant R as Model runtime
    participant D as Metadata database
    U->>A: Submit upload and exact version
    A->>G: Check current approval
    G-->>A: Approved digest
    A->>R: Verify or reuse model and execute
    R-->>A: Output
    A->>D: Store prediction metadata
    A-->>U: Return results
